[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0010","text":"果穗，累不累？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0020","text":"没事的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0030","text":"是吗\n你每天都有好好努力、好好玩、好好睡呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0040","text":"诶嘿嘿……！\n啊！不过，扑克牌没怎么玩成……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0050","text":"是吗？\n不嫌弃的话，现在来玩吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0060","text":"──！\n可以吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0070","text":"当然\n不过有人在睡觉，我们安静点玩"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0080","text":"——好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0090","text":"我把扑克牌拿出来……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020900_03_0100","text":"好，请多指教"}]
